    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "For a CHAOS KNIGHTS Army Faction, your units begin with Deathly Terror (Aura). At the start of rounds 1, 3 and 5, you may pick one Dread ability or roll two D6 for abilities 1–6. Unlock both rolled results. Duplicates give no extra effect and a choice cannot repeat a selected ability. Unlocked abilities stack and last the battle. Deathly Terror and 1 Despair (Aura) each worsen enemy Leadership by 1 in range of a bearer at 9″. Despair adds to Deathly Terror. 2 Doom gives the bearer +1 to wound Battle-shocked targets. 3 Darkness gives the bearer Stealth. 4 Dismay (Aura) applies in the opponent’s Command phase, during their Battle-shock step. Test for Battle-shock on each enemy below Starting Strength within 9″ of the bearer. Under 5 Delirium (Aura), a failed Battle-shock test costs an enemy D3 mortal wounds if that enemy is below Half-strength and within the bearer’s 9″ radius. 6 Dominion extends the bearer’s Auras by 3″.",
